      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "The object of this Act is to protect the health and safety of people,\nand to protect the environment, by identifying risks posed by or as\na result of gene technology, and by managing those risks through\nregulating certain dealings with GMOs.",
      "skos:definition": "The object of this Act is to protect the health and safety of people,\nand to protect the environment, by identifying risks posed by or as\na result of gene technology, and by managing those risks through\nregulating certain dealings with GMOs.",
