      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "It is the intention of the Parliament that this Act form a component\nof a nationally consistent scheme for the regulation of certain\ndealings with GMOs by the Commonwealth and the States.",
      "skos:definition": "It is the intention of the Parliament that this Act form a component\nof a nationally consistent scheme for the regulation of certain\ndealings with GMOs by the Commonwealth and the States.",
