      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "(2) In this section:\nconstitutional corporation means a trading, foreign or financial\ncorporation within the meaning of paragraph 51(xx) of the\nConstitution.\nconstitutional trade or commerce means trade or commerce:\n(a) between Australia and places outside Australia; or\n(b) among the States; or\n(c) by way of the supply of services to the Commonwealth or to\na Commonwealth authority.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) In this section:\nconstitutional corporation means a trading, foreign or financial\ncorporation within the meaning of paragraph 51(xx) of the\nConstitution.\nconstitutional trade or commerce means trade or commerce:\n(a) between Australia and places outside Australia; or\n(b) among the States; or\n(c) by way of the supply of services to the Commonwealth or to\na Commonwealth authority.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-13"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-13-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-13-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-13-ss-2-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "02bea12b3822d52aeff46a223e7599ec4a1e73ee62db9222dba598c554ae59a3",
      "skos:note": "Defines constitutional corporation and trade or commerce."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-13-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13(2) Operation of Act",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 24,
      "values:originalText": "(2) In this section:\nconstitutional corporation means a trading, foreign or financial\ncorporation within the meaning of paragraph 51(xx) of the\nConstitution.\nconstitutional trade or commerce means trade or commerce:\n(a) between Australia and places outside Australia; or\n(b) among the States; or\n(c) by way of the supply of services to the Commonwealth or to\na Commonwealth authority."
    },
