      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If a corresponding State law is expressed to confer on the\nRegulator the power to vary the GMO Register, the Regulator may\nvary the GMO Register in accordance with the corresponding State\nlaw.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If a corresponding State law is expressed to confer on the\nRegulator the power to vary the GMO Register, the Regulator may\nvary the GMO Register in accordance with the corresponding State\nlaw.",
