      "skos:note": "Regulator may enter information on Record in accordance with corresponding State law."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-17-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "17(5) Conferral of functions on Commonwealth officers and bodies",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If a corresponding State law is expressed to confer on the\nRegulator the power to enter information on the Record of GMO\nDealings, the Regulator may enter the information on the Record in\naccordance with the corresponding State law."
    },
    {
