    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-17-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "17(6) Conferral of functions on Commonwealth officers and bodies",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-17-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Regulator may:\n(a) make any notations in the GMO Register that the Regulator\nconsiders necessary to identify entries that relate to dealings\nincluded on the Register as mentioned in subsection (3) or\n(4); and\n(b) make any notations in the Record of GMO Dealings that the\nRegulator considers necessary to identify entries that relate to\ninformation entered on the Record as mentioned in\nsubsection (5).",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The Regulator may:\n(a) make any notations in the GMO Register that the Regulator\nconsiders necessary to identify entries that relate to dealings\nincluded on the Register as mentioned in subsection (3) or\n(4); and\n(b) make any notations in the Record of GMO Dealings that the\nRegulator considers necessary to identify entries that relate to\ninformation entered on the Record as mentioned in\nsubsection (5).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-17"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-17-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-17-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b270be302e0a0eab0e4167a4d8c9cb464569e0c6d8781e69b14b5f80e17609ed",
      "skos:note": "Regulator may make notations in GMO Register and Record of GMO Dealings."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-17-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "17(6) Conferral of functions on Commonwealth officers and bodies",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Regulator may:\n(a) make any notations in the GMO Register that the Regulator\nconsiders necessary to identify entries that relate to dealings\nincluded on the Register as mentioned in subsection (3) or\n(4); and\n(b) make any notations in the Record of GMO Dealings that the\nRegulator considers necessary to identify entries that relate to\ninformation entered on the Record as mentioned in\nsubsection (5)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-17-ss-6-norm",
