    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-22",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "22 Consultation on policy principles",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-22"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.29",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Policy principles are to be developed in consultation with the\nfollowing:\n(a) the Gene Technology Technical Advisory Committee;\n(b) the Regulator;\n(c) the Ethics and Community Committee;\n(e) such Commonwealth and State agencies and such regulatory\nagencies as the Ministerial Council considers appropriate;\n(f) such industry groups as the Ministerial Council considers\nappropriate;\n(g) such environmental, consumer and other groups as the\nMinisterial Council considers appropriate.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Policy principles are to be developed in consultation with the\nfollowing:\n(a) the Gene Technology Technical Advisory Committee;\n(b) the Regulator;\n(c) the Ethics and Community Committee;\n(e) such Commonwealth and State agencies and such regulatory\nagencies as the Ministerial Council considers appropriate;\n(f) such industry groups as the Ministerial Council considers\nappropriate;\n(g) such environmental, consumer and other groups as the\nMinisterial Council considers appropriate.",
      "cml:asserts": [
