      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.31",
      "values:originalText": "The following is a simplified outline of this Part:\nThis Part establishes the office of the Gene Technology Regulator\n(the Regulator), and specifies the Regulator’s functions and\npowers.",
