      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "Subject to this Act, the Regulator has power to do all things\nnecessary or convenient to be done for or in connection with the\nperformance of the Regulator’s functions.",
      "skos:definition": "Subject to this Act, the Regulator has power to do all things\nnecessary or convenient to be done for or in connection with the\nperformance of the Regulator’s functions.",
      "cml:asserts": [
