    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-33-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "33(4) Person not to deal with a GMO without a licence—strict liability",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 36,
      "values:originalText": "(4) In this section:\nexempt dealing has the same meaning as in section 32.\n\n\nRegulation of dealings with GMOs  Part 4\nDealings with GMOs must be licensed  Division 2\nSection 34\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024"
    },
    {
