          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-35b-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-35b-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4f04224daa6b625a4c6c8c9feb17d92912d18a68d73b17d6fb50e067c59304c7",
      "skos:note": "Breach of emergency dealing conditions is an offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-35b-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "35B(3) Person must not breach conditions of emergency dealing",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 39,
      "values:originalText": "(3) An offence under this section is punishable on conviction by a fine\nof not more than whichever of the following amounts applies:\n(a) in the case of an aggravated offence—200 penalty units;\n(b) in any other case—50 penalty units.\nNote:\nSection 38 defines aggravated offence."
    },
