    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-42",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "42 Regulator may require applicant to give further information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-42"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.43",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Regulator may, by notice in writing, require an applicant for a\nlicence to give the Regulator such further information in relation to\nthe application as the Regulator requires.\n(2) The notice may specify the period within which the information is\nto be provided.\n(3) The Regulator may require information to be given under this\nsection at any time before the Regulator decides the application,\nwhether before or after the Regulator has begun to consider the\napplication.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Regulator may, by notice in writing, require an applicant for a\nlicence to give the Regulator such further information in relation to\nthe application as the Regulator requires.\n(2) The notice may specify the period within which the information is\nto be provided.\n(3) The Regulator may require information to be given under this\nsection at any time before the Regulator decides the application,\nwhether before or after the Regulator has begun to consider the\napplication.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-42-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-42-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-42-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a4ebc5a966a71b556ee30e2827f965f6cbd099188ca4d3f447c415c8db04b4d9"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-42",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "42 Regulator may require applicant to give further information",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 43,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Regulator may, by notice in writing, require an applicant for a\nlicence to give the Regulator such further information in relation to\nthe application as the Regulator requires.\n(2) The notice may specify the period within which the information is\nto be provided.\n(3) The Regulator may require information to be given under this\nsection at any time before the Regulator decides the application,\nwhether before or after the Regulator has begun to consider the\napplication."
    },
