          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-47-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-47-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0568be0d84c2eb07b8a7d001b15305086fbd30b4a64b12d85dd12772a5592c24",
      "skos:note": "Regulator must prepare risk assessment and plan before issuing licence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-47-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "47(1) What the Regulator must do in relation to application",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 46,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Before issuing the licence, the Regulator must prepare a risk\nassessment and a risk management plan in relation to the dealings\nproposed to be authorised by the licence.\n\n\nLicensing system  Part 5\nInitial consideration of licences for dealings not involving intentional release of a GMO\ninto the environment  Division 3\nSection 47\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-47-ss-1-norm",
