      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.46",
      "values:originalText": "(2) In preparing the risk assessment, the Regulator must take into\naccount the risks posed by the dealings proposed to be authorised\nby the licence, including any risks to the health and safety of\npeople or risks to the environment.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) In preparing the risk assessment, the Regulator must take into\naccount the risks posed by the dealings proposed to be authorised\nby the licence, including any risks to the health and safety of\npeople or risks to the environment.",
