      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.46",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In preparing the risk management plan, the Regulator must take\ninto account the means of managing any risks posed by the\ndealings proposed to be authorised by the licence in such a way as\nto protect:\n(a) the health and safety of people; and\n(b) the environment.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In preparing the risk management plan, the Regulator must take\ninto account the means of managing any risks posed by the\ndealings proposed to be authorised by the licence in such a way as\nto protect:\n(a) the health and safety of people; and\n(b) the environment.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-47"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-47-ss-3-norm"
        },
