    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-47-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "47(4) What the Regulator must do in relation to application",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-47-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.46",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Regulator may consult:\n(a) the States; and\n(b) the Gene Technology Technical Advisory Committee; and\n(c) relevant Commonwealth authorities or agencies; and\n(d) any local council that the Regulator considers appropriate;\nand\n(e) any other person the Regulator considers appropriate;\non any aspect of the application.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Regulator may consult:\n(a) the States; and\n(b) the Gene Technology Technical Advisory Committee; and\n(c) relevant Commonwealth authorities or agencies; and\n(d) any local council that the Regulator considers appropriate;\nand\n(e) any other person the Regulator considers appropriate;\non any aspect of the application.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-47"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-47-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-47-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ed3e4efc40d6a43dfad7ae501514ac89e8b1aed64d368715c1a89a9edab083c4",
      "skos:note": "Regulator may consult relevant parties for application"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-47-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "47(4) What the Regulator must do in relation to application",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 46,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Regulator may consult:\n(a) the States; and\n(b) the Gene Technology Technical Advisory Committee; and\n(c) relevant Commonwealth authorities or agencies; and\n(d) any local council that the Regulator considers appropriate;\nand\n(e) any other person the Regulator considers appropriate;\non any aspect of the application."
    },
