    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-55",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "55 Regulator must make a decision on licence and licence conditions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-55"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.55",
      "values:originalText": "After taking any steps required by Division 3 or 4 of this Part in\nrelation to an application for a GMO licence, the Regulator:\n(a) must decide whether to issue or refuse to issue the licence;\nand\n(b) if the Regulator decides to issue the licence—may impose\nconditions to which the licence is subject.",
      "skos:definition": "After taking any steps required by Division 3 or 4 of this Part in\nrelation to an application for a GMO licence, the Regulator:\n(a) must decide whether to issue or refuse to issue the licence;\nand\n(b) if the Regulator decides to issue the licence—may impose\nconditions to which the licence is subject.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-55-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-55-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "797ead30e9c1b6c113fc76be62dfa2dbf1780aa25298765c2ed30366d36abc9f",
      "skos:note": "Regulator must decide on licence and conditions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-55",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "55 Regulator must make a decision on licence and licence conditions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 55,
      "values:originalText": "After taking any steps required by Division 3 or 4 of this Part in\nrelation to an application for a GMO licence, the Regulator:\n(a) must decide whether to issue or refuse to issue the licence;\nand\n(b) if the Regulator decides to issue the licence—may impose\nconditions to which the licence is subject."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-55-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-55"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-55-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Regulator must make a decision",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-56",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56 Regulator must not issue the licence unless satisfied as to risk",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-56"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.55",
      "values:originalText": "management\n(1) The Regulator must not issue the licence unless the Regulator is\nsatisfied that any risks posed by the dealings proposed to be\nauthorised by the licence are able to be managed in such a way as\nto protect:\n(a) the health and safety of people; and\n(b) the environment.\n(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), the Regulator must have regard\nto the following:\n(a) the risk assessment prepared under section 47 or 50 in\nrelation to the dealings;\n(b) the risk management plan prepared under section 47 or 50 in\nrelation to the dealings;\n(c) any submissions received under section 52 in relation to the\nlicence;\n(d) any policy guidelines in force under section 23 that relate to:\n(i) risks that may be posed by the dealings proposed to be\nauthorised by the licence; or\n(ii) ways of managing such risks so as to protect the health\nand safety of people or to protect the environment.",
      "skos:definition": "management\n(1) The Regulator must not issue the licence unless the Regulator is\nsatisfied that any risks posed by the dealings proposed to be\nauthorised by the licence are able to be managed in such a way as\nto protect:\n(a) the health and safety of people; and\n(b) the environment.\n(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), the Regulator must have regard\nto the following:\n(a) the risk assessment prepared under section 47 or 50 in\nrelation to the dealings;\n(b) the risk management plan prepared under section 47 or 50 in\nrelation to the dealings;\n(c) any submissions received under section 52 in relation to the\nlicence;\n(d) any policy guidelines in force under section 23 that relate to:\n(i) risks that may be posed by the dealings proposed to be\nauthorised by the licence; or\n(ii) ways of managing such risks so as to protect the health\nand safety of people or to protect the environment.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-56-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-56-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "288965a1f2c883c71bff8a4b3a1b76cc77d11e65f70910d5feff411a4e5fe1b3"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-56",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "56 Regulator must not issue the licence unless satisfied as to risk",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 55,
      "values:originalText": "management\n(1) The Regulator must not issue the licence unless the Regulator is\nsatisfied that any risks posed by the dealings proposed to be\nauthorised by the licence are able to be managed in such a way as\nto protect:\n(a) the health and safety of people; and\n(b) the environment.\n(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), the Regulator must have regard\nto the following:\n(a) the risk assessment prepared under section 47 or 50 in\nrelation to the dealings;\n(b) the risk management plan prepared under section 47 or 50 in\nrelation to the dealings;\n(c) any submissions received under section 52 in relation to the\nlicence;\n(d) any policy guidelines in force under section 23 that relate to:\n(i) risks that may be posed by the dealings proposed to be\nauthorised by the licence; or\n(ii) ways of managing such risks so as to protect the health\nand safety of people or to protect the environment."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-56-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "56(1) Regulator must not issue the licence unless satisfied as to risk",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-56-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
