    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-57",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "57 Other circumstances in which Regulator must not issue the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-57"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.56",
      "values:originalText": "licence\n(1) The Regulator must not issue the licence if the Regulator is\nsatisfied that issuing the licence would be inconsistent with a\npolicy principle in force under section 21.\n(2) The Regulator must not issue the licence unless the Regulator is\nsatisfied that the applicant is a suitable person to hold the licence.\n(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to an inadvertent dealings\napplication.",
      "skos:definition": "licence\n(1) The Regulator must not issue the licence if the Regulator is\nsatisfied that issuing the licence would be inconsistent with a\npolicy principle in force under section 21.\n(2) The Regulator must not issue the licence unless the Regulator is\nsatisfied that the applicant is a suitable person to hold the licence.\n(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to an inadvertent dealings\napplication.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-57-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-57-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-57-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8178ac72b28d77fcb851fcd301583182bd05d9663ed2ec8131e60f057c2795f7"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-57",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "57 Other circumstances in which Regulator must not issue the",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 56,
      "values:originalText": "licence\n(1) The Regulator must not issue the licence if the Regulator is\nsatisfied that issuing the licence would be inconsistent with a\npolicy principle in force under section 21.\n(2) The Regulator must not issue the licence unless the Regulator is\nsatisfied that the applicant is a suitable person to hold the licence.\n(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to an inadvertent dealings\napplication."
    },
