      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "A person (the first person) does not incur any civil liability in\nrespect of loss, damage or injury of any kind suffered by another\nperson because the first person gave information to the Regulator\nunder section 65, 66 or paragraph 72D(2)(h).\n\n\nLicensing system  Part 5\nSuspension, cancellation and variation of licences  Division 7\nSection 68\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024",
      "skos:definition": "A person (the first person) does not incur any civil liability in\nrespect of loss, damage or injury of any kind suffered by another\nperson because the first person gave information to the Regulator\nunder section 65, 66 or paragraph 72D(2)(h).\n\n\nLicensing system  Part 5\nSuspension, cancellation and variation of licences  Division 7\nSection 68\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-67-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-67-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ec2589cf4c5a79402f7a1c5916a5ccf8872d4d92e53f1db35723a29bdf19ee7d",
      "skos:note": "No civil liability for providing information"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-67",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "67 Protection of persons who give information",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 62,
      "values:originalText": "A person (the first person) does not incur any civil liability in\nrespect of loss, damage or injury of any kind suffered by another\nperson because the first person gave information to the Regulator\nunder section 65, 66 or paragraph 72D(2)(h).\n\n\nLicensing system  Part 5\nSuspension, cancellation and variation of licences  Division 7\nSection 68\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024"
    },
