        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The application for variation proposes, in relation to any GMO...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...unless..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-71-ss-2b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "71(2B) Variation of licence",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-71-ss-2b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.64",
      "values:originalText": "(2B) If an application has been made for variation of a licence, the\nRegulator must not vary the licence unless the Regulator is\nsatisfied that the risks posed by the dealings proposed to be\nauthorised by the licence as varied are covered by:\n(a) the risk assessment and the risk management plan in respect\nof the original application for the licence; or\n(b) the risk assessment and the risk management plan in respect\nof an application for another licence, but only if that other\nlicence was issued.",
      "skos:definition": "(2B) If an application has been made for variation of a licence, the\nRegulator must not vary the licence unless the Regulator is\nsatisfied that the risks posed by the dealings proposed to be\nauthorised by the licence as varied are covered by:\n(a) the risk assessment and the risk management plan in respect\nof the original application for the licence; or\n(b) the risk assessment and the risk management plan in respect\nof an application for another licence, but only if that other\nlicence was issued.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-71"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-71-ss-2b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-71-ss-2b-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-71-ss-2b-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-71-ss-2b-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-71-ss-2b-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-71-ss-2b-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0c8efced71431188b15a7f6a2341021c88d14bb7341a13976b76038f1defb685",
      "skos:note": "Regulator must not vary licence unless certain conditions met"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-71-ss-2b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "71(2B) Variation of licence",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "(2B) If an application has been made for variation of a licence, the\nRegulator must not vary the licence unless the Regulator is\nsatisfied that the risks posed by the dealings proposed to be\nauthorised by the licence as varied are covered by:\n(a) the risk assessment and the risk management plan in respect\nof the original application for the licence; or\n(b) the risk assessment and the risk management plan in respect\nof an application for another licence, but only if that other\nlicence was issued."
    },
