          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-72-ss-2-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1e5c00d09072bbe778ad33605ddffbeedbb127ddeedc41d2b4bc0f7dab18adba",
      "skos:note": "Regulator must notify licence holder of proposed suspension, cancellation or variation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-72-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "72(2) Regulator to notify of proposed suspension, cancellation or",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 66,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The notice:\n(a) must state that the Regulator proposes to suspend, cancel or\nvary the licence; and\n\n\nLicensing system  Part 5\nSuspension, cancellation and variation of licences  Division 7\nSection 72\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024\n(b) may require the licence holder to give to the Regulator any\ninformation of a kind specified in the notice that is relevant\nto the proposed suspension, cancellation or variation; and\n(c) may invite the licence holder to make a written submission to\nthe Regulator about the proposed suspension, cancellation or\nvariation."
    },
    {
