      "cml:premiseText": "The Minister becomes aware of risks to the health and safety of people, or to the environment, associated with the continuation of the dealings authorised by the emergency dealing determination."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-72e-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "72E(3) Variation, suspension and revocation of emergency dealing",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-72e-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.76",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister must not:\n(a) vary an emergency dealing determination (unless the\nvariation is of a minor technical nature); or\n(b) suspend or revoke an emergency dealing determination;\nunless the States have been consulted in relation to the variation,\nsuspension or revocation, as the case requires.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Minister must not:\n(a) vary an emergency dealing determination (unless the\nvariation is of a minor technical nature); or\n(b) suspend or revoke an emergency dealing determination;\nunless the States have been consulted in relation to the variation,\nsuspension or revocation, as the case requires.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-72e"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-72e-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-72e-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d509a32a41e9de5128d6182856c6f90362668e4e33af4c90c1712cc7760908f1",
      "skos:note": "Minister cannot vary, suspend or revoke emergency dealing determination without consulting States."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-72e-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "72E(3) Variation, suspension and revocation of emergency dealing",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 76,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister must not:\n(a) vary an emergency dealing determination (unless the\nvariation is of a minor technical nature); or\n(b) suspend or revoke an emergency dealing determination;\nunless the States have been consulted in relation to the variation,\nsuspension or revocation, as the case requires."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-72e-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-72e-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-72e-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Cannot",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition of varying, suspending or revoking emergency dealing determination.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "States have not been consulted.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Minister must consult States."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-72e-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "72E(4) Variation, suspension and revocation of emergency dealing",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-72e-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.76",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A variation, suspension or revocation of an emergency dealing\ndetermination takes effect:\n\n\nEmergency dealing determinations  Part 5A\nVariation, suspension and revocation of emergency dealing determination  Division 4\nSection 72E\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024\n(a) if the Minister states in the variation, suspension or\nrevocation that the variation, suspension or revocation is\nnecessary to prevent imminent risk of death, serious illness,\nserious injury or serious environmental damage—on the day\non which the variation, suspension or revocation is made; or\n(b) in any other case—on the day specified by the Minister in the\nvariation, suspension or revocation.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A variation, suspension or revocation of an emergency dealing\ndetermination takes effect:\n\n\nEmergency dealing determinations  Part 5A\nVariation, suspension and revocation of emergency dealing determination  Division 4\nSection 72E\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024\n(a) if the Minister states in the variation, suspension or\nrevocation that the variation, suspension or revocation is\nnecessary to prevent imminent risk of death, serious illness,\nserious injury or serious environmental damage—on the day\non which the variation, suspension or revocation is made; or\n(b) in any other case—on the day specified by the Minister in the\nvariation, suspension or revocation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-72e"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-72e-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-72e-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1685768687ef0a8b4fe808d38ee6d8e49031d833fce85891cbbdb0faaef87cb9",
      "skos:note": "Variation, suspension or revocation of emergency dealing determination takes effect on specified day."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-72e-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "72E(4) Variation, suspension and revocation of emergency dealing",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 76,
      "values:originalText": "(4) A variation, suspension or revocation of an emergency dealing\ndetermination takes effect:\n\n\nEmergency dealing determinations  Part 5A\nVariation, suspension and revocation of emergency dealing determination  Division 4\nSection 72E\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024\n(a) if the Minister states in the variation, suspension or\nrevocation that the variation, suspension or revocation is\nnecessary to prevent imminent risk of death, serious illness,\nserious injury or serious environmental damage—on the day\non which the variation, suspension or revocation is made; or\n(b) in any other case—on the day specified by the Minister in the\nvariation, suspension or revocation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-72e-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-72e-ss-4"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-72e-ss-4-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "takesEffect",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation takes effect",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(4) A variation, suspension or revocation of an emergency dealing determination",
      "cml:conclusionText": "on the day specified by the Minister in the variation, suspension or revocation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-72e-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "72E(5) Variation, suspension and revocation of emergency dealing",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-72e-ss-5"
      },
