      "skos:definition": "(1) The Regulator must not make a determination under\nsubsection 78(1) in respect of a dealing with a GMO unless the\nRegulator is satisfied:\n(a) that any risks posed by the dealing are minimal; and\n(b) that it is not necessary for persons undertaking the dealing to\nhold, or be covered by a GMO licence, in order to protect the\nhealth and safety of people or to protect the environment.",
