        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-79-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e9ea9d5a4a8eee56b827a325dbfbcf2282b9c8e0605d312108c9aba3bb6b64e6",
      "skos:note": "Regulator must not make determination unless risks can be assessed as minimal."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-79-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "79(1) Regulator not to make determination unless risks can be",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 82,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Regulator must not make a determination under\nsubsection 78(1) in respect of a dealing with a GMO unless the\nRegulator is satisfied:\n(a) that any risks posed by the dealing are minimal; and\n(b) that it is not necessary for persons undertaking the dealing to\nhold, or be covered by a GMO licence, in order to protect the\nhealth and safety of people or to protect the environment."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-79-ss-1-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-79-ss-1"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-79-ss-1-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MustNot",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Regulator must not make determination unless risks can be assessed as minimal.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-79-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "79(2) Regulator not to make determination unless risks can be",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-79-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.82",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), the Regulator must have regard\nto the following:\n(a) any data available to the Regulator about adverse effects\nposed by the dealing;\n(b) any other information as to risks associated with the dealing\nof which the Regulator is aware, including information\nprovided to the Regulator by a licence holder under\nsection 65 or by another person under section 66;\n(c) whether there is a need for the dealing to be subject to\nconditions;\n(d) any other information in relation to whether the dealing\nshould be authorised by a GMO licence.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of subsection (1), the Regulator must have regard\nto the following:\n(a) any data available to the Regulator about adverse effects\nposed by the dealing;\n(b) any other information as to risks associated with the dealing\nof which the Regulator is aware, including information\nprovided to the Regulator by a licence holder under\nsection 65 or by another person under section 66;\n(c) whether there is a need for the dealing to be subject to\nconditions;\n(d) any other information in relation to whether the dealing\nshould be authorised by a GMO licence.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-79"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-79-ss-2-norm"
