    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-80",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "80 Variation of GMO Register",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-80"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.82",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Regulator may, by legislative instrument, vary the GMO\nRegister.\n(2) A variation may:\n(a) remove a dealing from the GMO Register; or\n(b) revoke or vary conditions to which a dealing on the GMO\nRegister is subject; or\n(c) impose additional conditions to which a dealing on the GMO\nRegister is subject.\n\n\nRegulation of notifiable low risk dealings and dealings on the GMO Register  Part 6\nThe GMO Register  Division 3\nSection 81\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Regulator may, by legislative instrument, vary the GMO\nRegister.\n(2) A variation may:\n(a) remove a dealing from the GMO Register; or\n(b) revoke or vary conditions to which a dealing on the GMO\nRegister is subject; or\n(c) impose additional conditions to which a dealing on the GMO\nRegister is subject.\n\n\nRegulation of notifiable low risk dealings and dealings on the GMO Register  Part 6\nThe GMO Register  Division 3\nSection 81\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-80-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-80-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "196372e22a256aad848f95d0ce90f7e7dd805e119f4d053a5d43eb12786e008d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-80",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "80 Variation of GMO Register",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 82,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Regulator may, by legislative instrument, vary the GMO\nRegister.\n(2) A variation may:\n(a) remove a dealing from the GMO Register; or\n(b) revoke or vary conditions to which a dealing on the GMO\nRegister is subject; or\n(c) impose additional conditions to which a dealing on the GMO\nRegister is subject.\n\n\nRegulation of notifiable low risk dealings and dealings on the GMO Register  Part 6\nThe GMO Register  Division 3\nSection 81\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024"
    },
