    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-80-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "80(2) Variation of GMO Register",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 82,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A variation may:\n(a) remove a dealing from the GMO Register; or\n(b) revoke or vary conditions to which a dealing on the GMO\nRegister is subject; or\n(c) impose additional conditions to which a dealing on the GMO\nRegister is subject.\n\n\nRegulation of notifiable low risk dealings and dealings on the GMO Register  Part 6\nThe GMO Register  Division 3\nSection 81\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024"
    },
