    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-94",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "94 Conditions of accreditation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-94"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.90",
      "values:originalText": "The accreditation of an accredited organisation is subject to the\nfollowing conditions:\n(a) any conditions imposed by the Regulator at the time of\naccreditation;\n(b) any conditions imposed by the Regulator under section 95\nafter accreditation;\n(c) any conditions prescribed by the regulations.",
      "skos:definition": "The accreditation of an accredited organisation is subject to the\nfollowing conditions:\n(a) any conditions imposed by the Regulator at the time of\naccreditation;\n(b) any conditions imposed by the Regulator under section 95\nafter accreditation;\n(c) any conditions prescribed by the regulations.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-94-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-94-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5cffebd33006a63c786f7bb01b72f511e2e3996d62914bc7fbe60f24decfe91e",
      "skos:note": "Conditions for accreditation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-94",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "94 Conditions of accreditation",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 90,
      "values:originalText": "The accreditation of an accredited organisation is subject to the\nfollowing conditions:\n(a) any conditions imposed by the Regulator at the time of\naccreditation;\n(b) any conditions imposed by the Regulator under section 95\nafter accreditation;\n(c) any conditions prescribed by the regulations."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-94-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-94"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-94-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Regulator imposes obligations on accredited organisations",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Regulator has authority to impose conditions",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Accredited organisation must comply with conditions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-95",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "95 Variation of accreditation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-95"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.90",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Regulator may, at any time, by notice in writing given to an\naccredited organisation, vary the organisation’s accreditation.\n(2) Without limiting subsection (1), the Regulator may:\n(a) impose additional conditions; or\n(b) remove or vary conditions that were imposed by the\nRegulator.\n\n\nCertification and accreditation  Part 7\nAccredited organisations  Division 3\nSection 96\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Regulator may, at any time, by notice in writing given to an\naccredited organisation, vary the organisation’s accreditation.\n(2) Without limiting subsection (1), the Regulator may:\n(a) impose additional conditions; or\n(b) remove or vary conditions that were imposed by the\nRegulator.\n\n\nCertification and accreditation  Part 7\nAccredited organisations  Division 3\nSection 96\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-95-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-95-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "97eb6b7d5d4960d3f0ede7d094dc85c84de03a1e6a3a69e50da2a051778decfc"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-95",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "95 Variation of accreditation",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 90,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Regulator may, at any time, by notice in writing given to an\naccredited organisation, vary the organisation’s accreditation.\n(2) Without limiting subsection (1), the Regulator may:\n(a) impose additional conditions; or\n(b) remove or vary conditions that were imposed by the\nRegulator.\n\n\nCertification and accreditation  Part 7\nAccredited organisations  Division 3\nSection 96\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024"
    },
