      "skos:note": "The Minister must ensure that the Committee includes at least one person who is a member of the Ethics and Community Committee."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-100-ss-7a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "100(7A) The Gene Technology Technical Advisory Committee",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 94,
      "values:originalText": "(7A) The Minister must ensure that the Committee includes at least one\nperson who is a member of the Ethics and Community Committee.\nThe Minister is not required to be satisfied that this person has\nskills or experience in an area mentioned in subsection (5)."
    },
