      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.102",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may appoint one or more persons (expert advisers) to\ngive expert advice to the Ethics and Community Committee to\nassist it in the performance of its functions. Expert advisers may be\nappointed on a continuing or an ad hoc basis.\n(2) Expert advisers are not members of the Ethics and Community\nCommittee.\n\n\nAdministration  Part 9\nSimplified outline  Division 1\nSection 117\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may appoint one or more persons (expert advisers) to\ngive expert advice to the Ethics and Community Committee to\nassist it in the performance of its functions. Expert advisers may be\nappointed on a continuing or an ad hoc basis.\n(2) Expert advisers are not members of the Ethics and Community\nCommittee.\n\n\nAdministration  Part 9\nSimplified outline  Division 1\nSection 117\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024",
      "cml:hasPart": [
