    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-124",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "124 Remuneration",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-124"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.107",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Regulator is to be paid the remuneration that is determined by\nthe Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that\nremuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the Regulator is to be\npaid the remuneration that is prescribed by the regulations.\n(2) The Regulator is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed by\nthe regulations.\n(3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Regulator is to be paid the remuneration that is determined by\nthe Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that\nremuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the Regulator is to be\npaid the remuneration that is prescribed by the regulations.\n(2) The Regulator is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed by\nthe regulations.\n(3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-124-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-124-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-124-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "67917113dc20494e6297cb5eb0d86f5f5cef8ba37d469c83d4d00ec0d482c23e"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-124",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "124 Remuneration",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 107,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Regulator is to be paid the remuneration that is determined by\nthe Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that\nremuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the Regulator is to be\npaid the remuneration that is prescribed by the regulations.\n(2) The Regulator is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed by\nthe regulations.\n(3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act\n1973."
    },
    {
