    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-128",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "128 Notional payments by the Commonwealth",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-128"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.108",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The purpose of this section is to ensure that fees and charges under\nthis Act and the regulations, and charges under the Gene\nTechnology (Licence Charges) Act 2000, are notionally payable by\nthe Commonwealth (or parts of the Commonwealth).\n(2) The Minister responsible for administering the Public Governance,\nPerformance and Accountability Act 2013 may give written\ndirections for the purpose of this section, including directions\nrelating to the transfer of amounts within, or between, accounts\noperated by the Commonwealth.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The purpose of this section is to ensure that fees and charges under\nthis Act and the regulations, and charges under the Gene\nTechnology (Licence Charges) Act 2000, are notionally payable by\nthe Commonwealth (or parts of the Commonwealth).\n(2) The Minister responsible for administering the Public Governance,\nPerformance and Accountability Act 2013 may give written\ndirections for the purpose of this section, including directions\nrelating to the transfer of amounts within, or between, accounts\noperated by the Commonwealth.",
