    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-138",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "138 Record of GMO Dealings",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-138"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.113",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Regulator must maintain a Record of GMO Dealings (the\nRecord).\n(2) The purpose of the Record is to maintain a comprehensive record\nof all dealings in Australia that involve GMOs.\n(3) The Record must contain the following information, other than\nconfidential commercial information, in relation to each licence\nissued under section 55:\n(a) the name of the licence holder;\n(b) the persons covered by the licence;\n(c) the dealings authorised by the licence and the GMO to which\nthose dealings relate;\n(d) any licence conditions;\n(e) the date on which the licence was issued, and its expiry date\n(if any).\n(3A) The Record must contain the following information, other than\nconfidential commercial information, in relation to each emergency\ndealing determination made under section 72B:\n(a) the dealings specified in the emergency dealing\ndetermination and the GMO to which those dealings relate;\n(b) any conditions to which the emergency dealing determination\nis subject;\n(c) the date on which the emergency dealing determination takes\neffect;\n(d) the date on which the emergency dealing determination will\ncease to have effect.\n(4) The Record must contain the following information, other than\nconfidential commercial information, in relation to each notifiable\nlow risk dealing that is notified to the Regulator in accordance with\nregulations under section 75:",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Regulator must maintain a Record of GMO Dealings (the\nRecord).\n(2) The purpose of the Record is to maintain a comprehensive record\nof all dealings in Australia that involve GMOs.\n(3) The Record must contain the following information, other than\nconfidential commercial information, in relation to each licence\nissued under section 55:\n(a) the name of the licence holder;\n(b) the persons covered by the licence;\n(c) the dealings authorised by the licence and the GMO to which\nthose dealings relate;\n(d) any licence conditions;\n(e) the date on which the licence was issued, and its expiry date\n(if any).\n(3A) The Record must contain the following information, other than\nconfidential commercial information, in relation to each emergency\ndealing determination made under section 72B:\n(a) the dealings specified in the emergency dealing\ndetermination and the GMO to which those dealings relate;\n(b) any conditions to which the emergency dealing determination\nis subject;\n(c) the date on which the emergency dealing determination takes\neffect;\n(d) the date on which the emergency dealing determination will\ncease to have effect.\n(4) The Record must contain the following information, other than\nconfidential commercial information, in relation to each notifiable\nlow risk dealing that is notified to the Regulator in accordance with\nregulations under section 75:",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-138-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-138-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-138-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-138-ss-3a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-138-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7775e0036bbea77b1d015dde834134e7f332e625c2e7b08467d78f07ffe16cf7"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-138",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "138 Record of GMO Dealings",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 113,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Regulator must maintain a Record of GMO Dealings (the\nRecord).\n(2) The purpose of the Record is to maintain a comprehensive record\nof all dealings in Australia that involve GMOs.\n(3) The Record must contain the following information, other than\nconfidential commercial information, in relation to each licence\nissued under section 55:\n(a) the name of the licence holder;\n(b) the persons covered by the licence;\n(c) the dealings authorised by the licence and the GMO to which\nthose dealings relate;\n(d) any licence conditions;\n(e) the date on which the licence was issued, and its expiry date\n(if any).\n(3A) The Record must contain the following information, other than\nconfidential commercial information, in relation to each emergency\ndealing determination made under section 72B:\n(a) the dealings specified in the emergency dealing\ndetermination and the GMO to which those dealings relate;\n(b) any conditions to which the emergency dealing determination\nis subject;\n(c) the date on which the emergency dealing determination takes\neffect;\n(d) the date on which the emergency dealing determination will\ncease to have effect.\n(4) The Record must contain the following information, other than\nconfidential commercial information, in relation to each notifiable\nlow risk dealing that is notified to the Regulator in accordance with\nregulations under section 75:"
    },
