    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-140",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "140 Regulator may review notifiable low risk dealings",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-140"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.115",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Regulator may, at any time, in accordance with this Division,\nconsider the following matters:\n(a) whether a dealing with a GMO should be a notifiable low\nrisk dealing;\n(b) whether an existing notifiable low risk dealing should no\nlonger be a notifiable low risk dealing.\n(2) The basis of the Regulator’s consideration must relate to:\n(a) the matters of which the Regulator must be satisfied under\nsubsection 74(2); or\n(b) the matters the Regulator must consider under\nsubsection 74(3).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Regulator may, at any time, in accordance with this Division,\nconsider the following matters:\n(a) whether a dealing with a GMO should be a notifiable low\nrisk dealing;\n(b) whether an existing notifiable low risk dealing should no\nlonger be a notifiable low risk dealing.\n(2) The basis of the Regulator’s consideration must relate to:\n(a) the matters of which the Regulator must be satisfied under\nsubsection 74(2); or\n(b) the matters the Regulator must consider under\nsubsection 74(3).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-140-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-140-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "04ec3f6454f95154bfb9f5fc02f1067ce44dbaba501bf63fe21c515351430747"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-140",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "140 Regulator may review notifiable low risk dealings",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 115,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Regulator may, at any time, in accordance with this Division,\nconsider the following matters:\n(a) whether a dealing with a GMO should be a notifiable low\nrisk dealing;\n(b) whether an existing notifiable low risk dealing should no\nlonger be a notifiable low risk dealing.\n(2) The basis of the Regulator’s consideration must relate to:\n(a) the matters of which the Regulator must be satisfied under\nsubsection 74(2); or\n(b) the matters the Regulator must consider under\nsubsection 74(3)."
    },
