      "skos:definition": "(1) The Regulator may, at any time, in accordance with this Division,\nconsider the following matters:\n(a) whether a dealing with a GMO should be a notifiable low\nrisk dealing;\n(b) whether an existing notifiable low risk dealing should no\nlonger be a notifiable low risk dealing.",
