    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-143",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "143 What Regulator may do after consideration",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-143"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.116",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n(a) the matter relates to whether a dealing should be a notifiable\nlow risk dealing; and\n(b) the Regulator is satisfied as mentioned in subsection 74(2);\nand\n(c) the Regulator has considered the matters mentioned in\nsubsection 74(3);\nthe Regulator may recommend to the Ministerial Council that the\ndealing be declared to be a notifiable low risk dealing.\n(2) If:\n(a) the matter relates to whether an existing notifiable low risk\ndealing be reconsidered; and\n(b) after having had regard to the matters mentioned in\nsection 74, the Regulator considers that the dealing should\nnot be a notifiable low risk dealing;\nthe Regulator may recommend to the Ministerial Council that the\nregulations be amended accordingly.\n(3) If the matter relates to whether a dealing:\n(a) should be an exempt dealing; or\n\n\nAdministration  Part 9\nReviews of notifiable low risk dealings and exemptions  Division 7\nSection 144\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024\n(b) should cease to be an exempt dealing;\nthe Regulator may recommend to the Ministerial Council that the\nregulations be amended accordingly.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If:\n(a) the matter relates to whether a dealing should be a notifiable\nlow risk dealing; and\n(b) the Regulator is satisfied as mentioned in subsection 74(2);\nand\n(c) the Regulator has considered the matters mentioned in\nsubsection 74(3);\nthe Regulator may recommend to the Ministerial Council that the\ndealing be declared to be a notifiable low risk dealing.\n(2) If:\n(a) the matter relates to whether an existing notifiable low risk\ndealing be reconsidered; and\n(b) after having had regard to the matters mentioned in\nsection 74, the Regulator considers that the dealing should\nnot be a notifiable low risk dealing;\nthe Regulator may recommend to the Ministerial Council that the\nregulations be amended accordingly.\n(3) If the matter relates to whether a dealing:\n(a) should be an exempt dealing; or\n\n\nAdministration  Part 9\nReviews of notifiable low risk dealings and exemptions  Division 7\nSection 144\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024\n(b) should cease to be an exempt dealing;\nthe Regulator may recommend to the Ministerial Council that the\nregulations be amended accordingly.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-143-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-143-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-143-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "81c1f78e586f1b040426fc44f4a28684e8d560c626b1526b5d75cfbb8923234d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-143",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "143 What Regulator may do after consideration",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 116,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n(a) the matter relates to whether a dealing should be a notifiable\nlow risk dealing; and\n(b) the Regulator is satisfied as mentioned in subsection 74(2);\nand\n(c) the Regulator has considered the matters mentioned in\nsubsection 74(3);\nthe Regulator may recommend to the Ministerial Council that the\ndealing be declared to be a notifiable low risk dealing.\n(2) If:\n(a) the matter relates to whether an existing notifiable low risk\ndealing be reconsidered; and\n(b) after having had regard to the matters mentioned in\nsection 74, the Regulator considers that the dealing should\nnot be a notifiable low risk dealing;\nthe Regulator may recommend to the Ministerial Council that the\nregulations be amended accordingly.\n(3) If the matter relates to whether a dealing:\n(a) should be an exempt dealing; or\n\n\nAdministration  Part 9\nReviews of notifiable low risk dealings and exemptions  Division 7\nSection 144\nGene Technology Act 2000\nCompilation date: 14/10/2024\n(b) should cease to be an exempt dealing;\nthe Regulator may recommend to the Ministerial Council that the\nregulations be amended accordingly."
    },
