        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) If a person has refused or failed, is refusing or failing, or is about to refuse or fail...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Court may grant an injunction requiring the person to do the thing."
    },
