      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.137",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a thing is seized under this Part, the inspector must provide a\nreceipt for the thing.\n(2) If 2 or more things are seized, they may be covered in the one\nreceipt.",
