      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.140",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subject to subsection (3), the magistrate may issue the warrant if\nthe magistrate is satisfied, by information on oath, that it is\nreasonably necessary that one or more inspectors should have\naccess to the premises for the purposes of finding out whether this\nAct or the regulations have been complied with.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Subject to subsection (3), the magistrate may issue the warrant if\nthe magistrate is satisfied, by information on oath, that it is\nreasonably necessary that one or more inspectors should have\naccess to the premises for the purposes of finding out whether this\nAct or the regulations have been complied with.",
