    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-172-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "172(4) Monitoring warrants",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-172-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.140",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The warrant must:\n(a) authorise one or more inspectors (whether or not named in\nthe warrant), with such assistance and by such force as is\nnecessary and reasonable:\n(i) to enter the premises; and\n(ii) to exercise the powers set out in section 153 in relation\nto the premises; and\n(b) state whether the entry is authorised to be made at any time\nof the day or night or during specified hours of the day or\nnight; and\n(c) specify the day (not more than 6 months after the issue of the\nwarrant) on which the warrant ceases to have effect; and\n(d) state the purpose for which the warrant is issued.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The warrant must:\n(a) authorise one or more inspectors (whether or not named in\nthe warrant), with such assistance and by such force as is\nnecessary and reasonable:\n(i) to enter the premises; and\n(ii) to exercise the powers set out in section 153 in relation\nto the premises; and\n(b) state whether the entry is authorised to be made at any time\nof the day or night or during specified hours of the day or\nnight; and\n(c) specify the day (not more than 6 months after the issue of the\nwarrant) on which the warrant ceases to have effect; and\n(d) state the purpose for which the warrant is issued.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-172"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-172-ss-4-norm"
