    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-173-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "173(3) Offence-related warrants",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-173-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.140",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The magistrate must not issue the warrant unless the inspector or\nsome other person has given to the magistrate, either orally or by\naffidavit, such further information (if any) as the magistrate\nrequires concerning the grounds on which the issue of the warrant\nis being sought.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The magistrate must not issue the warrant unless the inspector or\nsome other person has given to the magistrate, either orally or by\naffidavit, such further information (if any) as the magistrate\nrequires concerning the grounds on which the issue of the warrant\nis being sought.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-173"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-173-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-173-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-173-ss-3-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "23e545ca24301cb9164dcf045ff2802fc768d5ccd0e0afa218b7f04b80c74dd6",
      "skos:note": "Magistrate must provide further information before issuing warrant. Inspector must prepare information before applying for warrant.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-173-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "173(3) Offence-related warrants",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 140,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The magistrate must not issue the warrant unless the inspector or\nsome other person has given to the magistrate, either orally or by\naffidavit, such further information (if any) as the magistrate\nrequires concerning the grounds on which the issue of the warrant\nis being sought."
    },
    {
