      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.140",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The magistrate may require communication by voice to the extent\nthat it is practicable in the circumstances.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The magistrate may require communication by voice to the extent\nthat it is practicable in the circumstances.",
