      "values:originalText": "The following table sets out:\n(a) decisions that are reviewable decisions; and\n(b) each eligible person in relation to a reviewable decision:\nReviewable decisions and eligible persons\nItem\nDecision\nProvision under\nwhich decision made\nEligible person in\nrelation to decision\n1A\nTo refuse to consider\nan application on the\nbasis that the applicant\nis not a suitable person\nto hold a licence\nparagraph 43(2)(f)\nthe applicant\nTo refuse to issue a\nlicence\nsection 55\nthe applicant for the\nlicence\nTo impose a licence\ncondition\nsection 55\nthe licence holder\nTo suspend or cancel a\nlicence\nsection 68\nthe licence holder\n3A\nTo refuse to transfer a\nlicence\nsection 70\nan applicant for the\ntransfer\nTo vary a licence\nsection 71\nthe licence holder\n4A\nTo refuse to vary a\nlicence\nsection 71\nthe licence holder\nTo refuse to certify a\nfacility\nsection 84\nthe applicant for\ncertification\nTo specify a condition\nof a certification\nsection 86\nthe holder of the\ncertification\nTo vary a certification\nsection 87\nthe holder of the\ncertification\n7A\nTo refuse to transfer a\nsection 89A\nan applicant for the",
