    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-182",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "182 Deadlines for making reviewable decisions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-182"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.149",
      "values:originalText": "If:\n(a) this Act provides for a person to make an application of any\nkind to the Regulator; and\n(b) a period is specified under this Act or the regulations for\ngiving notice of the decision to the applicant; and\n(c) the Regulator has not notified the applicant of the\nRegulator’s decision within that period;\nthe Regulator is taken, for the purposes of this Act, to have made a\nreviewable decision to reject the application, and the person may\nseek internal review of the reviewable decision under section 181.",
      "skos:definition": "If:\n(a) this Act provides for a person to make an application of any\nkind to the Regulator; and\n(b) a period is specified under this Act or the regulations for\ngiving notice of the decision to the applicant; and\n(c) the Regulator has not notified the applicant of the\nRegulator’s decision within that period;\nthe Regulator is taken, for the purposes of this Act, to have made a\nreviewable decision to reject the application, and the person may\nseek internal review of the reviewable decision under section 181.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-182-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-182-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "13c3015db088d391b21cf74ef74a5fa15baa9f2be0c770d6764a80fce8061bef",
      "skos:note": "Regulator must notify applicant within specified period"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-182",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "182 Deadlines for making reviewable decisions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 149,
      "values:originalText": "If:\n(a) this Act provides for a person to make an application of any\nkind to the Regulator; and\n(b) a period is specified under this Act or the regulations for\ngiving notice of the decision to the applicant; and\n(c) the Regulator has not notified the applicant of the\nRegulator’s decision within that period;\nthe Regulator is taken, for the purposes of this Act, to have made a\nreviewable decision to reject the application, and the person may\nseek internal review of the reviewable decision under section 181."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-182-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-182"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-182-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Regulator has a duty to notify applicant",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-183",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "183 Review of decisions by Administrative Review Tribunal",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-183"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.150",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to the Administrative Review Tribunal Act 2024, an\napplication may be made by an eligible person in relation to:\n(a) a reviewable decision made by the Regulator personally; or\n(b) a decision made by the Regulator under section 181 (which\nprovides for internal review).\n(2) In this section:\ndecision has the same meaning as in the Administrative Review\nTribunal Act 2024.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to the Administrative Review Tribunal Act 2024, an\napplication may be made by an eligible person in relation to:\n(a) a reviewable decision made by the Regulator personally; or\n(b) a decision made by the Regulator under section 181 (which\nprovides for internal review).\n(2) In this section:\ndecision has the same meaning as in the Administrative Review\nTribunal Act 2024.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-183-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:gene-technology-act-2000-sec-183-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f5b70bfe52b4693c6429da04df88783ba2f1ea6b66513752a2ea2f3d1dc7091e"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-183",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "183 Review of decisions by Administrative Review Tribunal",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 150,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to the Administrative Review Tribunal Act 2024, an\napplication may be made by an eligible person in relation to:\n(a) a reviewable decision made by the Regulator personally; or\n(b) a decision made by the Regulator under section 181 (which\nprovides for internal review).\n(2) In this section:\ndecision has the same meaning as in the Administrative Review\nTribunal Act 2024."
    },
    {
