      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f00931a90928fca5578747d478a11f17cb260060ab8697b0e574e04fde33f3e6",
      "skos:note": "No imprisonment for certain offenses if convicted by a non-corporate person"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/gene-technology-act-2000#sec-188-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "188(5) Conduct by directors, employees and agents",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 156,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If:\n(a) a person other than a body corporate is convicted of an\noffence; and\n(b) the person would not have been convicted of the offence if\nsubsections (3) and (4) had not been enacted;\nthe person is not liable to be punished by imprisonment for that\noffence."
    },
