      "dc:source": "gene-technology-act-2000.pdf, p.160",
      "values:originalText": "(2) In this section:\nauthorised GMO dealings, in relation to premises or a facility,\nmeans dealings with GMOs being undertaken at the premises or\nfacility:\n(a) that are authorised to be undertaken at the premises or facility\nby a GMO licence; or\n(aa) that are specified in an emergency dealing determination and\nare not prohibited from being undertaken at the premises or\nfacility by a condition of the determination; or\n(b) that are notifiable low risk dealings; or\n(c) that are exempt dealings; or\n(d) that are dealings included on the GMO Register.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) In this section:\nauthorised GMO dealings, in relation to premises or a facility,\nmeans dealings with GMOs being undertaken at the premises or\nfacility:\n(a) that are authorised to be undertaken at the premises or facility\nby a GMO licence; or\n(aa) that are specified in an emergency dealing determination and\nare not prohibited from being undertaken at the premises or\nfacility by a condition of the determination; or\n(b) that are notifiable low risk dealings; or\n(c) that are exempt dealings; or\n(d) that are dealings included on the GMO Register.",
